# Changelog

## [1.0.0] - 2026-05-19

### Added
- Initial release
- Peer dependencies resolver
- Smart deduplication (`mip dedupe`)
- `mip ci --frozen-lockfile`
- `mip audit --fix`
- Legacy packages fallback
- Auto-save dependencies
- i18n support (10 languages)
- Windows, Linux, macOS builds
- GitHub Actions CI/CD

### Fixed
- No more node_modules duplication
- Peer dependency conflicts handling
- Lockfile integrity checks